      "value": "Oculus user here.\n\nI struggle alot with brightness in general since my eyes are very light sensitive. All bright colors and specially blue hurts my eyes like hell. Sometimes feel like acid in my eyes if its too bright.\n\nI looked in the options before starting VRChat and not even there is any adjustments possible for the game.\n\nPlease add some options for people with light sensitivity.",
